text:
More incredible artist friends:

@DownsandTowns - an incredible photographer and human being.

@harvey_rayner - a master of generative art who pushes the limits of code to new dimensions.

@RebeccaRose - weaves incredible journeys with her collages.

@otherworld_xx - I was struck by his work since 2022 but I finally got to hang out with him now, he is simply a certified king.

@egodead - not only an incredible artist, and kind human, but we share the same passion for fashion, it's always refreshing to learn more about the different worlds other artists enjoy beyond art.

@rainerhosch - he simply is THE portrait legend, I feel honored to have been in front of his camera with his unforgettable smile, a humble and kind person who's captured some of the most iconic people.

Thank you for being a great friend my brother, love you!

@dave_krugman - not only an incredible photographer but also the network master, I admire his unique way of making friends all over the world and always connecting them to help make things happen.

You are an absolute legend Dave!

@Dalos - part of the Web3 Mexican gang and an incredible photographer aswell as ai artist.

@oveck - a fellow charming latino photographer who has become a very close friend over the years, un abrazo mi hermano!

@OmarZRobles - what can I say, he is simply one of the most hardworking and full of energy photographers I've met, seeing him document Marfa and @AdamWeitsman is admirable, he embodies the Latino spirit of pursuing what you love no matter what.

@neort_io & @NORIWTS - brought a truly incredible curation to Marfa, the unique blend of hardware and software they rendered the artworks with was an impressive way to showcase the collection that highlighted the fascinating creative potential from many Japanese artists.

@seanbonner - and his camera, he is always there to document everything with his acute eye for details in his signature black and white.

@AP0LL_0 - and I shared the best Bordo sandwiches ever.
